# GOI KHACH — CACH LY DU LIEU. `tenants/<slug>/data/knowledge.json` chua gia si, dieu khoan cong no
# va chat ID nhom Zalo that. Image la BAN CHUNG cho moi khach, nen mot goi nam trong image nghia la
# khach B tu host co the `docker save` roi doc gia si cua khach A. Image chi mang code + schema +
# loader; du lieu that den luc CHAY qua volume mount (TENANT_DIR) hoac tu DB.
# Khoa bang deploy/netviet/image-isolation.contract.mjs — no kiem IMAGE THAT, khong chi kiem file nay.
tenants
